{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830325908,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeKe3TiuKUBtJoOy","part":{"partID":"prt_1e4395855001jbjg73bXdGM6vN","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeKe3TiuKUBtJoOy","messageID":"msg_1e43945fb001927xi0z5vCAoaO","type":"tool","id":"call_01_i8065gi1cauwh0uuitiy4r07","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n 1,60p .skilled/commands/create/assets/create-skill-confirm.yaml"},"output":"# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# OPENCODE CREATE: SK-SKILL UNIFIED WORKFLOW (CONFIRM MODE)\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Mode: interactive execution with explicit checkpoints\n# Entrypoint: /create:sk-skill\n# Operations: full-create | full-update | reference-only | asset-only\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nrole: Unified Skill Creator using sk-doc\npurpose: Execute a canonical checkpointed workflow for skill creation and skill document updates\naction: Route one operation branch with user checkpoints, hard gates, and validation loops\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# PREREQUISITE: @markdown AGENT VERIFICATION\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# This workflow REQUIRES the @markdown agent for:\n#   - Template-first generation\n#   - sk-doc standards enforcement\n#   - Root document validation\n#\n# The command markdown verifies the @markdown agent BEFORE\n# this YAML workflow loads. If you are executing this workflow,\n# @markdown verification has already passed.\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\noperating_mode:\n  workflow: unified_7_step\n  workflow_compliance: MANDATORY\n  workflow_execution: interactive\n  approvals: step_by_step\n  tracking: checkpoint_decision_log\n  validation: checkpoint_based\n  supports_operations:\n    - full-create\n    - full-update\n    - reference-only\n    - asset-only\n  description: |\n    Executes the 7-step skill creation workflow with approval gates at each checkpoint.\n    User confirms, reviews, or modifies at each step before the workflow advances.\n\ndevelopment_philosophy:\n  principle: \"Interactive confidence comes from explicit checkpoints and clear branch contracts\"\n  approach: \"Normalize -> Resolve -> Execute -> Validate -> Integrate -> Persist\"\n  mandate: \"Never continue past a checkpoint without an explicit outcome\"\n\nruntime_agent_path_resolution:\n  default: .skilled/agents\n  claude: .claude/agents\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# CONFIDENCE & CLARIFICATION FRAMEWORK\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconfidence_framework:\n  thresholds:\n    high: { range: \"80-100%\", action: \"Proceed with standard checkpointing\" }\n    medium: { range: \"40-79%\", action: \"Proceed with caution and highlight assumptions\" }\n    low: { range: \"0-39%\", action: \"Pause and request clarification before next checkpoint\" }\n  scoring_weights:\n    input_completeness: 0.35\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# OPENCODE CREATE: SK-SKILL UNIFIED WORKFLOW (CONFIRM MODE)\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Mode: interactive execution with explicit checkpoints\n# Entrypoint: /create:sk-skill\n# Operations: full-create | full-update | reference-only | asset-only\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nrole: Unified Skill Creator using sk-doc\npurpose: Execute a canonical checkpointed workflow for skill creation and skill document updates\naction: Route one operation branch with user checkpoints, hard gates, and validation loops\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# PREREQUISITE: @markdown AGENT VERIFICATION\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# This workflow REQUIRES the @markdown agent for:\n#   - Template-first generation\n#   - sk-doc standards enforcement\n#   - Root document validation\n#\n# The command markdown verifies the @markdown agent BEFORE\n# this YAML workflow loads. If you are executing this workflow,\n# @markdown verification has already passed.\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\noperating_mode:\n  workflow: unified_7_step\n  workflow_compliance: MANDATORY\n  workflow_execution: interactive\n  approvals: step_by_step\n  tracking: checkpoint_decision_log\n  validation: checkpoint_based\n  supports_operations:\n    - full-create\n    - full-update\n    - reference-only\n    - asset-only\n  description: |\n    Executes the 7-step skill creation workflow with approval gates at each checkpoint.\n    User confirms, reviews, or modifies at each step before the workflow advances.\n\ndevelopment_philosophy:\n  principle: \"Interactive confidence comes from explicit checkpoints and clear branch contracts\"\n  approach: \"Normalize -> Resolve -> Execute -> Validate -> Integrate -> Persist\"\n  mandate: \"Never continue past a checkpoint without an explicit outcome\"\n\nruntime_agent_path_resolution:\n  default: .skilled/agents\n  claude: .claude/agents\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# CONFIDENCE & CLARIFICATION FRAMEWORK\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nconfidence_framework:\n  thresholds:\n    high: { range: \"80-100%\", action: \"Proceed with standard checkpointing\" }\n    medium: { range: \"40-79%\", action: \"Proceed with caution and highlight assumptions\" }\n    low: { range: \"0-39%\", action: \"Pause and request clarification before next checkpoint\" }\n  scoring_weights:\n    input_completeness: 0.35\n"}],"providerCall":{"exe