{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830374052,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeKe3TiuKUBtJoOy","part":{"partID":"prt_1e43a12d7001KuipoQobZMxbB6","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeKe3TiuKUBtJoOy","messageID":"msg_1e439ea5c001966xDo1DAastoQ","type":"tool","id":"call_00_tomlsj58majpzj9zj0pyx7u0","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - docs-7\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the docs area of code review pass seven. Tracks dimension coverage, findings, and the next focus across the lineage's iterations.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Read at the start of every iteration before any review action.\n- Updated in place after the iteration's findings are written.\n- Machine-owned blocks stay between their markers.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass seven, docs area: this branch's net change to the root `README.md` against `origin/main`, checking that the `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` rename reached both of the README's command surfaces and that every command name the README gives resolves to a file under `.skilled/commands`.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- correctness\n- security\n- traceability\n- maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting the pass-seven recorded limits without a new breaking input: `:auto.md` reading as the command, a `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes reading as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only, `started` versus `offered` not rebuilding from `readOnly`, and older goal rows keeping old-rule figures.\n- Reviewing the scorer and attach-config scope paths of pass seven, except as read-only context evidence for a docs claim.\n- Reviewing pre-existing README prose that this branch's net diff does not touch, except where the rename makes it false.\n- Changing code or docs under review.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Three iterations reached (`maxIterations: 3`).\n- Weighted new-finding ratio at or below the 0.10 convergence threshold after the minimum two iterations.\n- A hard gate failure that prevents further review.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [ ] correctness\n- [ ] security\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: docs command-name traceability, correctness of the changed lines, maintainability of the renamed name\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: traceability - Focus area: every command name the README gives and the renamed `/create:sk-skill` surfaces - Reason: the pass-seven brief names the command-name check as the docs area's job - Rotation status: not started - Required evidence: one resolution per command name and a read of each changed line - Recovery note: none\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `README.md` only, per `review/review-scope-7.txt` line 10.\n- Behavior claims: the net diff `origin/main..1c3d62def5a` for `README.md` (two lines: 269 and 603, the `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` rename), and the brief's instruction that each command name the README gives exists under `.skilled/commands`.\n- Reuse and conventions: the command tree's own index at `.skilled/commands/README.txt`, the create group index at `.skilled/commands/create/README.txt`, and pass-six lineage reports for prior documented limits.\n- Review risks and gaps: the README's command section names 44 commands of which only the create group's first name changed; pre-existing count and prose claims are context, not branch findings.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[Alignment checks completed across core and overlay protocols]\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Not run yet |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | Not run yet |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | Not run yet |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | Not run yet |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | Not run yet |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | Not run yet |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[Per-file coverage state table -- populated during initialization from scope discovery]\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| README.md | - | - | 0 | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-docs-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 60 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T11:59:13.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-7/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/docs-7/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"# Deep Review Strategy - docs-7\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent review state for the docs area of code review pass seven. Tracks dimension coverage, findings, and the next focus across the lineage's iterations.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Read at the start of every iteration before any review action.\\n- Updated in place after the iteration's findings are written.\\n- Machine-owned blocks stay between their markers.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass seven, docs area: this branch's net change to the root `README.md` against `origin/main`, checking that the `/create:skill` to `/create:sk-skill` rename reached both of the README's command surfaces and that every command name the README gives resolves to a file under `.skilled/commands`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- correctness\\n- security\\n- traceability\\n- maintainability\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Re-reporting the pass-seven recorded limits without a new breaking input: `:auto.md` reading as the command, a `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes reading as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only, `started` versus `offered` not rebuilding from `readOnly`, and older goal rows keeping old-rule figures.\\n- Reviewing the scorer and atta